 (very high priority)=0AThese are priorities fo some of the items running i=
n the system=0A=A0=A0=A0=A0 Threads in the app (10 ... 98, FIFO)=A0 =0A=A0=
=A0=A0=A0 Serial console isr (99, FIFO)=0A=A0=A0=A0=A0 Driver used by app (=
99, FIFO)=0ADifferent threads fail at different times (even ones with prior=
ity 50 or 98)=0A=0ASystem randomly fails after running for anywhere from 1 =
to 20 minutes.=0AWhen it fails, these are the symptoms observed.=0A1. Runni=
ng function/thread gets preempted and never gets time to run after that.=0A=
=A0=A0 Console locks up, can no longer run ethernet traffic.=0A=A0=A0 It is=
 possible to get some console use by changing the scheduler =0A=A0=A0 throt=
