g processor status (ps) shows that this thread is running even =0Athough we=
 =0A=0A=A0=A0 never returned to the function=0A=A0=A0 Using a top utility ,=
 it is reported that that particular thread consumes =0A=A0=A0 about 95% of=
 the CPU resources.=0A3. Using a JTAG based debugger=0A=A0=A0=A0=A0 -- the =
