e function that fails we never hit the=0Abreakpoint (we expected function t=
o return after preemption)=0A=0AI am looking for suggestions on how to reso=
lve this problem. Why doesnt the =0Athread run ?=0AWhy is the system locked=
 up ?=0AIs there any tools included in the kernel that can allow me to debu=
g this ?=0AI am not aware of an available lttng package available for this =
